      "english": "Who knows what'll\nhappen inside [blue]Nabeya[/color]?\fBring plenty of Gin Tama.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00060830",
      "source_words_sha256": "893a65f907e0b9755ab72eac461e662b4d6fb81ca45171e36a326cc95bd91068",
      "english": "...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00060B2C",
      "source_words_sha256": "02293c0e58d481641aed98f58fe9f54d5a572c1f714da160a8fa8dc10e9dccbd",
      "english": "Don't give up.\nI'm quietly rooting for you.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00060B60",
      "source_words_sha256": "51c243fb221ef77db50ee95ad93fea608f8bc396939a515032009357f3cd6ecf",
      "english": "Huh? You got a job\nat [blue]Nabeya[/color]?\nThat's amazing.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00060BF0",
      "source_words_sha256": "816ee90328cac1110cb8886aa146b4ab6589cb55a3b12505f2fbe35e6df17237",
      "english": "We're not wandering aimlessly. We're job hunting.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00060CC4",
      "source_words_sha256": "0b53f3952c8d0bfc7d58d6414c152e97cc2a6348b54f298ee811d8705c34cefd",
      "english": "Job hunting!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00060CD8",
      "source_words_sha256": "388c8f653019b44d43ce592c30ce0b66023d655f39c4c6b2803558c7c51a1f11",
      "english": "Enough already!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00060CEC",
      "source_words_sha256": "af31086e7533b67bdd66b7d9825a168ad08309bcc20d5edd2bea0e6723aaad9d",
      "english": "Oh, the Yorozuya? Where to, all together?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00060DC8",
      "source_words_sha256": "9f7cfbe48d5393a493cf33eb75add3b461d8a76500faeea840c779de9d8dedd9",
      "english": "Found work?\fRemember! Tell me if there's something good!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00060E88",
      "source_words_sha256": "0840cc482fd715d84f99820c45aa246270076def9f348f6a96a6024ae6315c71",
      "english": "Whatever suits you, huh...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00060EE0",
      "source_words_sha256": "57dbbaea01505cb716c20b37ff09043ce178b115d4eb23354ee4d90ca65ab328",
      "english": "Oh, pretty sharp!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00060EF8",
      "source_words_sha256": "a45f81ddc3c343a651c7a05576ade346a851ab3081cfd854b70269eec07aaa2f",
      "english": "That's right! No more calling me a loser!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00060FD0",
      "source_words_sha256": "3f2905481050b9216518cc164528a310abeede5c2169134c7cc167b6f71bfd68",
      "english": "Well, good luck, losers!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061038",
      "source_words_sha256": "788a043516e0c23e540bd5547d62f376153f3cf916e334a6f9a6094b8d08ecc2",
      "english": "No way! You got a job\nat THE [blue]Nabeya[/color]?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061070",
      "source_words_sha256": "569ae6e4be1441bde321e45ce52948e43ab54ab4d1333eb3cf0974db91e79533",
      "english": "[blue]Nabeya[/color]'s sunk low.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000610AC",
      "source_words_sha256": "893a65f907e0b9755ab72eac461e662b4d6fb81ca45171e36a326cc95bd91068",
      "english": "...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000610C8",
      "source_words_sha256": "482c907ed2e6802964b40dc48d8104bb064efdbe63506f3212d6c3229d068a7b",
      "english": "Kid goes straight for the sore spot...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061134",
      "source_words_sha256": "26fb5c15be12ffd3857b9049f555c2b8b1da7d802a0a41675cbfcfcfcc4877c2",
      "english": "Wouldn't tell you. I'd pick it up myself.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061168",
      "source_words_sha256": "7d2e5aacdbbe9ba667ff5890799029b53d28103d07222baef76eb9ee0a6be47f",
      "english": "Right. Better collect Gin Tama than hunt for work...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000611B0",
      "source_words_sha256": "5360d741633f02746a05492600fdba3a835379cfa31c582d6020818046da2940",
      "english": "Damn, I'm jealous!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000611C8",
      "source_words_sha256": "d7ae1a60a9de15a5026283e2b4fc885fd0f98b878773df13fda514a5ddfb251a",
      "english": "Hmph! Don't have to tell me!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000611F0",
      "source_words_sha256": "1303f615a8c6fc2e4d760797ab361a7f6d2431d595cdc86a6a7b9b7cec9d400a",
      "english": "Loser.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061224",
      "source_words_sha256": "52b1c2a581d9e212b245bb0c15f2bef1acbb166300171c21a296a5ef406efbc1",
      "english": "Tch. Cruel world.\fI'll search around the house.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061264",
      "source_words_sha256": "37b3504696c468320e00f55b8a32cf199c27c4bcf5cb0d1c669aa0a4f0a2e3aa",
      "english": "Heh heh. Found a Gin Tama round the neighborhood.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000612D0",
      "source_words_sha256": "307b61e875dfdd230eb0c57102e74370269a79cd2ef7aa244e6e2208f74c2f16",
      "english": "Is THAT what keeping at it means...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061310",
      "source_words_sha256": "f0ad67781f3b3c5c0d2ca758106d30f1003520f135291629c8e2018e1a316901",
      "english": "Another one getting it wrong.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061330",
      "source_words_sha256": "c17934d23b037c180e2409bd34f87031c1e1855185ea8a99d7d2cfb267d48494",
      "english": "Oh, Hamuko.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0006137C",
      "source_words_sha256": "909bc9616f3f9d5144af513059d37f44218e958a91096966c89f640f6eb1e9a7",
      "english": "Right.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0006138C",
      "source_words_sha256": "d28e674788d0d9a9331deab6ba78bace7b4463ea9932268a400bf463d6fbc5ed",
      "english": "Anyway, see you, Ham.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0006141C",
      "source_words_sha256": "e7240eb8dde65ad33f31aecc1a5a6eff544686f247f9c41550129e8b3603b21e",
      "english": "Don't go making things up!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061440",
      "source_words_sha256": "43083bb233bb62c4b031cbea271a4f160b381df76793530271cdf9d9fcd3d8a0",
      "english": "I'm HAM?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000614A4",
      "source_words_sha256": "8b2b1be899745965cd1734a99818949e8e1c4370fa06c41034697324b34e2966",
      "english": "At least add the ko!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000614C0",
      "source_words_sha256": "ca43a089b00ee889233d4892f472176c9108e50624b7e0e66eb01cc4b50b74ce",
      "english": "Not Ham! I'm Hamuko! ...Wait, what?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061500",
      "source_words_sha256": "c0b920237c862bf7669fab181c2038d0d306c85f801479d17145dcc2901d9996",
      "english": "Oh, you again.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061518",
      "source_words_sha256": "d5eb90a3c7ee5c8b35576a53741f421474f63baea3b2661996c91f7aca020c0f",
      "english": "Gin, no time for ham!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061548",
      "source_words_sha256": "faccc3bbbb416c597269ced2532650b1ca32e6df50527b869da5970f5b0cc22c",
      "english": "Go make yourself a sandwich filling.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000615B0",
      "source_words_sha256": "025ce6a41557fecd988cf29264d123ce4a9d001d8a2933e4b1bb822192955e55",
      "english": "Hey, your family's\nthe [blue]Recycle Shop[/color], right?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000615EC",
      "source_words_sha256": "e6629bc2088f9d94fd57b78b1e15ecd6144687a7826377cc8de4ed6d405f592e",
      "english": "Why?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061624",
      "source_words_sha256": "4c1edced1c73b430b1e1241f839e818701018539d0b16e9b8b9d2d97e94f2092",
      "english": "I get it! Never asking again!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061648",
      "source_words_sha256": "ab1811b66fc89a1922b16678d74a7368f640630c95ca9ae25e9b5b949598029c",
      "english": "Hah! No more treating us\nlike unwanted junk!\fGet this! We got jobs\nat the famous [blue]Nabeya[/color]!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000616C0",
      "source_words_sha256": "729f8575e3b90ee631142dba73d431d8233411f8fba12f5f33902456c84d2087",
      "english": "Why that reaction? Be a little more honest...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000616FC",
      "source_words_sha256": "893a65f907e0b9755ab72eac461e662b4d6fb81ca45171e36a326cc95bd91068",
      "english": "...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061718",
      "source_words_sha256": "c2bece6c2f41aa799874392059e271e873070c7ab6374ed676787a16684cdd12",
      "english": "Oh, you're...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061738",
      "source_words_sha256": "4b0e068178bf68fe9d32edb0674774154f6a000e5e3397052ee686d63e5bb34f",
      "english": "Yes, but...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061770",
      "source_words_sha256": "ea8daabd2d2c336e096c5c2f30092ff2c5aedac1f6bbb81ff29d3db33aeec934",
      "english": "Our [blue]Recycle Shop[/color]\nhandles unwanted things...\fBut unwanted people\naren't our business.\nSorry.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000617F0",
      "source_words_sha256": "fc2516bfb4f24e8eec30c85f2ceae013672cda31a0699b729fdef1aaae265a8f",
      "english": "Sorry, but...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061808",
      "source_words_sha256": "fc2516bfb4f24e8eec30c85f2ceae013672cda31a0699b729fdef1aaae265a8f",
      "english": "Sorry, but...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061830",
      "source_words_sha256": "e1f0393fdf60ee80d23ddafc87c3bf3941dfc6fdadb4192912d5c424ee45f7a7",
      "english": "What is [blue]Nabeya[/color] thinking?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000618FC",
      "source_words_sha256": "0a791f9abee28eb81fc686f56b82cc4c0137cf34f4fb925e46daefabc8f6e111",
      "english": "It's true. Though our methods were a bit questionable...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061948",
      "source_words_sha256": "3dd29ff26ebe7f31a2bcef8b7be306333f00d5e8fe57b108ea628ca7410889e0",
      "english": "Seems like an honest enough reaction, Gin.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000619B4",
      "source_words_sha256": "3f7acf540562667ce34407efd07d9155e175ba5d22a88db08c945b0431249f40",
      "english": "Shinpachi. Maybe even yakuza could hire us?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000619F4",
      "source_words_sha256": "a1dfaf72c3339c5036d1085b72c789476738ff1552b213b38b8c99083139c2b2",
      "english": "Hey, Shinpachi... Maybe these guys...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061A30",
      "source_words_sha256": "583b7cbfe112c13dceb8ba70b4b9a2256e5f0bd6a2cb8f58437fb56ebf2912dd",
      "english": "All right...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061A4C",
      "source_words_sha256": "917653a1e61853e911c4f8bc237d6c06a810bff41d437de273ba33d6ce64eba2",
      "english": "Hmph! Impressed now?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061A68",
      "source_words_sha256": "893a65f907e0b9755ab72eac461e662b4d6fb81ca45171e36a326cc95bd91068",
      "english": "...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061ABC",
      "source_words_sha256": "85ecb8af6365563197b37f4e5ef9cccb40f4fa4b9d389ce41c1ea617a8ba3f80",
      "english": "Not the yakuza! No way!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061ADC",
      "source_words_sha256": "cdfc50dd78f8e0aaed2865b14487f12d3b730e26d3432357629b684374c56f87",
      "english": "It WAS a bit of a yakuza method...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061B80",
      "source_words_sha256": "3771c9a867fdb2ed038a29fdaa859ad2df00a81d21c93e620d397568e8fbe2dc",
      "english": "Still looking miserable, huh.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061C64",
      "source_words_sha256": "54d9e5280a4ee07daf0ef13a8991175ad1c859eb6a72c27237ab208bdcfe204d",
      "english": "No! Absolutely NOT!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061C84",
      "source_words_sha256": "6f43cee1fc9ad9be5b4febbb2c4c93d7935e017162eab103dcff0f80810a1fbf",
      "english": "Not a method to brag about.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061CB8",
      "source_words_sha256": "324ac0d315e22d3572953920d61d75b8473234b7177ec9740053dad2354639c6",
      "english": "Still working? Poor guy. Shall we say hi?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061CF0",
      "source_words_sha256": "9e18e98292b0a111c5b203e96890d4a8a68e69957701eee4ea100a349333530f",
      "english": "Why?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061D38",
      "source_words_sha256": "dce8c77d7a99f70beaa7927f71a47f5ae23391065c636f0a6ff104d747284b25",
      "english": "We DID do it.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061D4C",
      "source_words_sha256": "362e904487d4f4a62cbcb29391b15fdfb8f91a695c3d0535d5c28900b96c2fd0",
      "english": "Is that how it works...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061D94",
      "source_words_sha256": "8c8ee2b19c190f9bbfe2258595fa32ab7eae2d143c5673bc409284f082229b4a",
      "english": "Shinpachi, you're worrying too much.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061DC4",
      "source_words_sha256": "4c62c9d44bd051bc3c733b2eb85bca1b8c79f031634c3b9b4e55026b86c06afc",
      "english": "Fine! Don't yell. Makes me hungry.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061DEC",
      "source_words_sha256": "92afe5a6292f9b6f1acc5913d89a03e4f410430475ceb621264963ed2d890d9a",
      "english": "Oh, Hasegawa's\noutside [blue]Nabeya[/color]...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061ED0",
      "source_words_sha256": "45167a76f158ed9809d21097c624a065c53c87033d9ef2212c0b0364b5c7e24b",
      "english": "Only people who've done their bare minimum can say that.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061F10",
      "source_words_sha256": "6dbdb007febc32937562e1081fa2492e1bf2ebc0567ab78b9758023b87dc4ca3",
      "english": "Are you an idiot?! No! Don't go near him!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061F54",
      "source_words_sha256": "e92b429a4da0ee12698f08b29ff944645262c47cc7819680eca5de41f77c5e95",
      "english": "Gin! No! Hasegawa's still over here!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061F98",
      "source_words_sha256": "97fa72eabc28a64a0af786c7d69b6c8bccccf7a410acdc6f5d804633a4bda473",
      "english": "Of course not! Come ON!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00061FEC",
      "source_words_sha256": "295d1c81b2465b0b1ef5daac9326540c0256e73c90078ec9acb1b14498a18f9f",
      "english": "How many times?! Hasegawa's here! Don't go this way!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00062038",
      "source_words_sha256": "5de1592a314224aeb6a6fa16308ba62e9c40d809212ccbe94cd1556d4d471934",
      "english": "Whose fault is THAT?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00062050",
      "source_words_sha256": "d9e38edbdc594551453a995f2ca55032f0741bcc288c4e973ef93c53b362bdae",
      "english": "What, Shinpachi? Keep it down!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00062070",
      "source_words_sha256": "5bcc18e5feabc6e59f9b784f127ccb78883bf0fbdf70a8fa79a92d3850086e5b",
      "english": "Where...? [blue]Nabeya[/color], right?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00062098",
      "source_words_sha256": "5d384c230ca8afc6668b9a7598c32ea0d5c4982447fe2052ce19e3381f272a9f",
      "english": "Huh? Was it?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000620B0",
      "source_words_sha256": "2d5b958c9b2edf8ac4a64d5c4f1fcd82cefed9f13f3d9f018941f6cfbb84fa13",
      "english": "Really?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0006210C",
      "source_words_sha256": "604f664715d31b5cfea44b58ec81a41294e934fe5c0724864e37603701ddd6c6",
      "english": "Yes. Just like life.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0006212C",
      "source_words_sha256": "893a65f907e0b9755ab72eac461e662b4d6fb81ca45171e36a326cc95bd91068",
      "english": "...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00062148",
      "source_words_sha256": "ba36b9d332e7dc463c0fdb525d9279ecb48818b4aaa718d937c854d184963eb7",
      "english": "Was it?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00062158",
